    "jurisdiction": "Toronto Public Health / Ontario O. Reg. 493/17 / Health Canada",
    "change_rule": "Only ADD or re-point a unit or limit with a dated migration note. Never silently redefine an active limit.",
    "note": "Temperatures verified 2026-06-22 against the sources below; pending CONC Food Safety Lead sign-off. The `units` array is PLACEHOLDER — replace with the real fridge/freezer inventory per site (Bloor/Rex/LAN); until placeholder_units is false, consumers (HUB form, PROOF R6) should treat unit-level numbers as not-yet-live.",
    "sources": {
